Copyright 2026 Arjun Aravind

This product is a Rust port of openapi-spec-validator
(https://github.com/python-openapi/openapi-spec-validator),
Copyright 2017-2023 Artur Maciag, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Its validation rules are ported from that project's source code,
and the OpenAPI meta-schemas in crates/openapi-spec-validator-rs/resources/schemas
are copied from it.

This product bundles the OpenAPI 3.1 and 3.2 schema dialect meta-schemas in
crates/openapi-spec-validator-rs/resources/dialects, as distributed with
openapi-schema-validator (https://github.com/python-openapi/openapi-schema-validator),
and ports that project's OpenAPI keywords and format checks to Rust.
